---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base>
  <section class="page">
   <p class="kicker">Formation</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Faith formation for elementary grades. Sacramental preparation for First Reconciliation and First Eucharist is listed on the Sacraments page.</p>
    <p>Contact Leslie Soell, (719) 542-9248 ext. 113, lsoell@ctkpueblo.org.</p>

    <h2>Middle and high school</h2>
    <p>Discipleship for middle and high school youth. Confirmation preparation is for incoming 7th and 8th grade and high school youth who still need the sacrament, after one year of formation.</p>
    <p>Contact Aden Casarez, ext. 114.</p>

    <h2>Adults</h2>
    <p>Adult formation includes Sunday sessions, small groups, and Bible studies. Call for the current schedule.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Men's Bible Study, Tuesdays, 9:00–10:00 a.m.</li>
      <li>Women's Bible Study, Wednesdays, 9:00–11:00 a.m.</li>
      <li>Sunday Formation for All</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Contact Sarah Nelson, ext. 121, snelson@ctkpueblo.org.</p>

    <h2>Register</h2>
    <p>Registration for Formation for All is open.</p>
    <p><a href="https://forms.ministryforms.net/embed.aspx?formId=45ec37d1-842d-48f3-a64b-2b0b16ebd5f0">Registration form</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .page {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 12px 32px 64px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .kicker {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  h3 {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1.25rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

.section-photo {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 560px;
  height: auto;
  object-fit: contain;
  margin: 1rem auto 1.25rem;
}

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .page {
      padding: 8px 4px 40px;
    }
  }
</style>